# Furnace of Rath's ruling (CR 616.1, 615.7): when damage meets the Furnace's doubling and a prevention shield, the player it
# would be dealt to orders them - whoever controls the Furnace. Bot2's Furnace; Bot2 Bolts Bot1, who shields itself with Healing
# Salve in response. Bot1 has the Salve apply first: 3 is prevented, nothing is left to double (CR 615.6), and Bot1 takes 0.
# At the second Bolt, with a second Salve, Bot1 has the Furnace apply first: 6, of which 3 are prevented, so Bot1 takes 3.

